  <conbody><p><keyword keyref="gemma-3-name"/> is a family of multimodal open models in 1B, 4B, 12B and 27B sizes. The card names the sizes but does not give exact parameter counts or design rationale.</p><p>Context windows are <keyword keyref="gemma-3-context-large"/> tokens for the 4B, 12B and 27B models and <keyword keyref="gemma-3-context-1b"/> for the 1B model.</p></conbody>
